# Slide-rate clamp in the core handling step (CCE 06035F48, DUSA 0602D43C).
# DUSA, 20 Hz: rate(+0x178) = clamp(target, +-768); slip(+0x5C) += rate * 7/8.
# CCE clamps at +-256 (a /3 rescale), halving how fast a slide can build in
# real time. The 30 Hz equivalent of 768 per tick is 512.
DAYTONA/RACE.BIN 06036158 06028000 0100 0200   # clamp, +0x1CB set path
DAYTONA/RACE.BIN 06036190 06028000 0100 0200   # clamp, +0x1CB clear path
